;   Mismatch      - Control signal mismatch (different clock/enable or clears pack to same register bank) ; 1,088 / 1,097 ( 99 % )  ;
;   Overuse       - Control signal overuse (requires more clock/enable or clears than are available)      ; 6 / 1,097 ( < 1 % )     ;
;   Functional    - Packing register will cause functional failure                                        ; 1 / 1,097 ( < 1 % )     ;
;   NoRegisters   - There are not enough registers to be packed                                           ; 1,097 / 1,097 ( 100 % ) ;
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------+


